1
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,509
♪The world keeps changing♪

2
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:19,979
♪A thousand years pass
in the blink of an eye♪

3
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:22,159
♪Shoulder to shoulder♪

4
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:24,399
♪We stand above the world♪

5
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,590
♪Our identities switch♪

6
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:29,320
♪The world turns upside down♪

7
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:31,729
♪Watch me♪

8
00:00:31,730 --> 00:00:35,319
♪Stir up a storm♪

9
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:37,609
♪Let's time-travel, bro♪

10
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:40,059
♪Our blood is boiling♪

11
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:45,289
♪The genius emperor plots
with brilliant strategy♪

12
00:00:45,290 --> 00:00:49,709
♪The slacker general
is unmatched in battle♪

13
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:52,199
♪The business world is in turmoil♪

14
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:54,749
♪The court is rife with intrigue♪

15
00:00:54,750 --> 00:00:59,169
♪We will conquer the world♪

16
00:00:59,170 --> 00:01:03,510
♪There's no escape for the traitors♪

17
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:07,999
=No Way! My Bro is the Emperor=

18
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,160
=Episode 20=

19
00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:15,069
(At this point,)

20
00:01:15,070 --> 00:01:16,310
(there's no other choice.)

21
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,520
Your Highness,
I've given it some thought.

22
00:01:19,660 --> 00:01:21,730
You're right.

23
00:01:22,210 --> 00:01:24,340
Commander of the Imperial Guards
has no future.

24
00:01:25,180 --> 00:01:27,740
Your Highness,
I'd rather take the easy way out.

25
00:01:28,460 --> 00:01:30,010
Glad you've come to your senses.

26
00:01:31,970 --> 00:01:33,260
That said,

27
00:01:33,580 --> 00:01:35,420
I do have a few requests.

28
00:01:37,690 --> 00:01:39,220
Let's hear them.

29
00:01:39,610 --> 00:01:40,780
I'm a man

30
00:01:40,820 --> 00:01:41,930
who loves money.

31
00:01:42,690 --> 00:01:43,459
If Your Highness

32
00:01:43,460 --> 00:01:45,260
doesn't pay me enough,

33
00:01:45,460 --> 00:01:46,700
the deal's off.

34
00:01:47,850 --> 00:01:48,810
Name your price.

35
00:01:49,020 --> 00:01:51,170
How much per month?

36
00:01:51,660 --> 00:01:53,780
For a man of my caliber,

37
00:01:54,210 --> 00:01:56,090
a thousand taels of gold
isn't too much, right?

38
00:01:57,740 --> 00:01:59,019
(The Zuixian House makes)

39
00:01:59,020 --> 00:02:00,980
(less than that in a day
selling Fushou Cream.)

40
00:02:01,210 --> 00:02:02,530
(You've got some nerve.)

41
00:02:05,410 --> 00:02:06,379
You really think

42
00:02:06,380 --> 00:02:08,460
you're some kind of prize?

43
00:02:10,300 --> 00:02:11,850
I'm young.

44
00:02:12,420 --> 00:02:14,130
Youth is an asset.

45
00:02:15,770 --> 00:02:18,180
I've seen plenty of young men.

46
00:02:18,290 --> 00:02:20,650
How am I anything like them?

47
00:02:20,760 --> 00:02:22,660
I may not come from a noble family,

48
00:02:22,670 --> 00:02:24,420
or have any great achievements,

49
00:02:24,580 --> 00:02:27,340
but my feelings for you are genuine.

50
00:02:27,580 --> 00:02:29,300
Smooth talker.

51
00:02:30,490 --> 00:02:31,739
Besides,

52
00:02:31,740 --> 00:02:35,089
the household money,

53
00:02:35,090 --> 00:02:37,699
the properties, and the carriages

54
00:02:37,700 --> 00:02:38,900
must all be under my control.

55
00:02:39,140 --> 00:02:39,859
You're

56
00:02:39,860 --> 00:02:41,620
the Princess Royal of Jing.

57
00:02:41,830 --> 00:02:44,170
At least give me some sense of security.

58
00:02:44,300 --> 00:02:46,150
I never realized you were...

59
00:02:48,630 --> 00:02:50,019
I can't even think of a word

60
00:02:50,020 --> 00:02:51,020
to describe you.

61
00:02:51,580 --> 00:02:52,690
Average but confident.

62
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:55,770
An average guy
with above-average confidence.

63
00:02:58,770 --> 00:03:00,370
How blind I've been.

64
00:03:02,980 --> 00:03:04,620
So you're not making me your consort?

65
00:03:05,650 --> 00:03:06,810
No.

66
00:03:08,300 --> 00:03:09,340
But

67
00:03:10,050 --> 00:03:11,259
that silver tongue of yours

68
00:03:11,260 --> 00:03:12,580
is rather entertaining.

69
00:03:14,490 --> 00:03:15,370
Guards.

70
00:03:18,330 --> 00:03:19,169
Yes, Your Highness.

71
00:03:19,170 --> 00:03:21,009
Castrate Gu Bei.

72
00:03:21,010 --> 00:03:22,739
Keep him by my side

73
00:03:22,740 --> 00:03:23,859
as a eunuch.

74
00:03:23,860 --> 00:03:25,179
He can keep me entertained.

75
00:03:25,180 --> 00:03:26,809
Do it now.

76
00:03:26,810 --> 00:03:28,300
Right here.

77
00:03:32,610 --> 00:03:34,460
Your Highness, someone is here to see you.

78
00:03:41,670 --> 00:03:43,020
Take care of this.

79
00:03:43,090 --> 00:03:44,160
Don't leave any loose ends.

80
00:03:44,330 --> 00:03:45,090
Yes.

81
00:04:00,050 --> 00:04:01,690
Greetings, Princess Royal.

82
00:04:03,460 --> 00:04:04,489
Didn't I say

83
00:04:04,490 --> 00:04:06,180
not to come unless summoned?

84
00:04:09,050 --> 00:04:10,459
Rest assured, Princess Royal.

85
00:04:10,460 --> 00:04:11,780
No one will discover.

86
00:04:12,140 --> 00:04:13,020
Well,

87
00:04:13,050 --> 00:04:14,480
I've come

88
00:04:14,610 --> 00:04:16,220
to ask about

89
00:04:16,380 --> 00:04:17,409
ceding

90
00:04:17,410 --> 00:04:19,460
the Six Prefectures of Yanyun.

91
00:04:20,330 --> 00:04:21,380
Six prefectures?

92
00:04:21,700 --> 00:04:22,819
Weren't we discussing

93
00:04:22,820 --> 00:04:23,940
only three?

94
00:04:24,530 --> 00:04:25,699
Our campaign

95
00:04:25,700 --> 00:04:26,900
has been costly.

96
00:04:27,330 --> 00:04:28,380
I'm afraid three prefectures

97
00:04:28,460 --> 00:04:30,730
won't satisfy our court.

98
00:04:45,620 --> 00:04:46,410
Well, well.

99
00:04:47,060 --> 00:04:48,459
Lucky you,

100
00:04:48,460 --> 00:04:49,960
brat.

101
00:04:52,650 --> 00:04:53,820
I'm famous

102
00:04:54,260 --> 00:04:55,850
for being quick.

103
00:04:57,970 --> 00:04:58,769
This one

104
00:04:58,770 --> 00:05:00,140
doesn't quite suit you.

105
00:05:08,330 --> 00:05:08,970
Eunuch.

106
00:05:09,970 --> 00:05:11,220
Let me show you something fun.

107
00:05:11,900 --> 00:05:13,020
What is it?

108
00:05:14,290 --> 00:05:15,649
No one else can see it.

109
00:05:15,650 --> 00:05:16,329
Come closer.

110
00:05:16,330 --> 00:05:17,290
I'll show you in secret.

111
00:05:31,940 --> 00:05:33,490
This one is a compensation for you.

112
00:05:56,530 --> 00:05:58,940
As long as you help me ascend the throne,

113
00:05:59,460 --> 00:06:00,970
I'll cede

114
00:06:01,460 --> 00:06:02,780
the six prefectures.

115
00:06:04,060 --> 00:06:06,900
But when will the Western Yi army arrive?

116
00:06:07,140 --> 00:06:08,089
Our army

117
00:06:08,090 --> 00:06:10,170
is less than a hundred li
from the capital.

118
00:06:10,330 --> 00:06:12,020
The capital's walls are strong.

119
00:06:12,210 --> 00:06:13,260
When the time comes,

120
00:06:13,330 --> 00:06:15,380
create chaos inside the city.

121
00:06:15,730 --> 00:06:17,490
Open the gates amid the confusion.

122
00:06:17,500 --> 00:06:19,970
That way, success is guaranteed.

123
00:06:20,940 --> 00:06:21,610
Who's there?

124
00:06:27,210 --> 00:06:28,150
Move.

125
00:06:28,200 --> 00:06:29,220
Let go.

126
00:06:33,650 --> 00:06:34,850
You heard everything?

127
00:06:35,700 --> 00:06:36,380
I didn't.

128
00:06:36,620 --> 00:06:38,380
I'm hard of hearing.
I didn't catch a thing.

129
00:06:38,530 --> 00:06:39,849
You never say

130
00:06:39,850 --> 00:06:41,329
a single honest word.

131
00:06:41,330 --> 00:06:42,700
Cut out his tongue.

132
00:06:42,940 --> 00:06:43,650
Hold on.

133
00:06:45,060 --> 00:06:46,380
I have a few questions.

134
00:06:46,650 --> 00:06:48,340
At least let me die knowing the truth.

135
00:06:49,020 --> 00:06:49,730
Fine.

136
00:06:49,900 --> 00:06:51,340
I'll grant you that.

137
00:06:51,390 --> 00:06:52,769
The mastermind behind Zuixian House

138
00:06:52,770 --> 00:06:53,900
wasn't Hu Wenyuan.

139
00:06:54,260 --> 00:06:55,220
It was you, right?

140
00:06:56,700 --> 00:06:59,460
Hu Wenyuan is nothing more
than my lackey.

141
00:07:00,820 --> 00:07:02,650
The city gates are guarded
by the Imperial Guards.

142
00:07:02,970 --> 00:07:04,260
How did you smuggle

143
00:07:04,330 --> 00:07:05,649
the drug money out?

144
00:07:05,650 --> 00:07:07,090
If the roads are blocked,

145
00:07:07,290 --> 00:07:08,940
there's always the river.

146
00:07:10,620 --> 00:07:12,220
The canal docks.

147
00:07:12,770 --> 00:07:13,460
Good.

148
00:07:13,650 --> 00:07:15,530
I've answered all your questions.

149
00:07:16,330 --> 00:07:17,089
Now,

150
00:07:17,090 --> 00:07:18,970
it's time to send you to your demise.

151
00:07:20,090 --> 00:07:21,410
Don't worry.

152
00:07:21,850 --> 00:07:23,050
Xiao Ce

153
00:07:23,260 --> 00:07:25,530
will soon join you.

154
00:07:26,260 --> 00:07:27,340
Spare me, Your Majesty!

155
00:07:28,900 --> 00:07:30,089
I'll pledge my loyalty to you,

156
00:07:30,090 --> 00:07:31,380
Your Majesty.

157
00:07:32,900 --> 00:07:34,020
I have a plan

158
00:07:34,330 --> 00:07:36,970
to get rid of Xiao Ce
without losing a single soldier.

159
00:07:37,090 --> 00:07:39,169
Xiao Ce has become calculating.

160
00:07:39,170 --> 00:07:40,849
He has countless shadow guards.

161
00:07:40,850 --> 00:07:42,490
How could you kill him?

162
00:07:43,090 --> 00:07:44,259
Others may not be able to,

163
00:07:44,260 --> 00:07:45,900
but I know him.

164
00:07:46,820 --> 00:07:49,460
What's that saying again?

165
00:07:50,530 --> 00:07:52,340
Know your enemy, know yourself.

166
00:07:54,650 --> 00:07:55,970
Why should I trust you?

167
00:08:04,500 --> 00:08:05,619
I know

168
00:08:05,620 --> 00:08:08,050
Xiao Ce possesses a devastating weapon

169
00:08:08,380 --> 00:08:10,050
powerful enough to wipe out an army.

170
00:08:10,090 --> 00:08:10,629
Otherwise,

171
00:08:10,630 --> 00:08:12,380
how do you think General Sun died?

172
00:08:16,530 --> 00:08:18,579
If you follow my plan,

173
00:08:18,580 --> 00:08:19,459
I can guarantee

174
00:08:19,460 --> 00:08:21,610
success.

175
00:08:21,650 --> 00:08:22,650
You're quite

176
00:08:22,820 --> 00:08:24,410
the smooth talker.

177
00:08:24,700 --> 00:08:26,970
Since you claim you want to serve me,

178
00:08:27,500 --> 00:08:29,139
let's see

179
00:08:29,140 --> 00:08:30,780
how sincere you are.

180
00:08:35,770 --> 00:08:38,420
This medicine is called
Bone-Melting Water.

181
00:08:38,450 --> 00:08:39,820
Once taken,

182
00:08:39,860 --> 00:08:42,220
it will destroy your bones and tendons.

183
00:08:42,500 --> 00:08:43,770
But don't worry.

184
00:08:44,100 --> 00:08:46,010
As long as you
take the antidote every day,

185
00:08:46,140 --> 00:08:47,580
the poison won't take effect.

186
00:08:56,930 --> 00:08:58,250
Given the situation,

187
00:08:58,450 --> 00:08:59,449
it's no longer about

188
00:08:59,450 --> 00:09:00,730
whether the two of us survive.

189
00:09:00,930 --> 00:09:03,250
It's about the nation

190
00:09:03,770 --> 00:09:04,940
and its people.

191
00:09:05,860 --> 00:09:07,540
Even if I long for an easy life,

192
00:09:07,650 --> 00:09:09,049
I can't find peace

193
00:09:09,050 --> 00:09:11,250
while the nation is in peril.

194
00:09:12,290 --> 00:09:13,770
Taking it easy isn't giving up.

195
00:09:14,620 --> 00:09:16,019
I simply don't want to be consumed

196
00:09:16,020 --> 00:09:17,340
by worldly affairs.

197
00:09:37,540 --> 00:09:39,379
♪Let's time-travel, bro♪

198
00:09:39,380 --> 00:09:41,779
♪Our spirit soars to the skies♪

199
00:09:41,780 --> 00:09:47,219
♪The brainy emperor plots the strategy♪

200
00:09:47,220 --> 00:09:51,579
♪The slacker general leads the charge♪

201
00:09:51,580 --> 00:09:53,979
♪Swords clash and warhorses thunder♪

202
00:09:53,980 --> 00:09:56,539
♪Let the history judge our deeds♪

203
00:09:56,540 --> 00:10:02,219
♪Our brotherhood is priceless♪

204
00:10:02,220 --> 00:10:07,780
♪Peace across the land, carefree at last♪

205
00:10:12,060 --> 00:10:14,100
♪Funny moments never stop♪

206
00:10:14,740 --> 00:10:16,940
♪Silly blunders never cease♪

207
00:10:17,140 --> 00:10:21,299
♪Yet through every up and down♪

208
00:10:21,300 --> 00:10:23,260
♪We create miracles♪

209
00:10:23,580 --> 00:10:26,020
♪From naive youths♪

210
00:10:26,300 --> 00:10:28,779
♪To legendary heroes♪

211
00:10:28,780 --> 00:10:30,699
♪This journey♪

212
00:10:30,700 --> 00:10:34,739
♪Is one we'll be proud of♪

213
00:10:34,740 --> 00:10:37,260
♪Let's time-travel, bro♪

214
00:10:39,740 --> 00:10:42,620
♪Let's create♪

215
00:10:44,660 --> 00:10:52,580
♪A legend of our own♪
